    },
    {
      slug: "nextaria",
      role: "Architect and tech lead: I run a team of AI agents that writes the code.",
      name: "Nextaria",
      status: "In progress",
      period: "since November 2026",
      privateNote: "Internal app, not launched yet",
      what: "A suite of web apps for window and door manufacturers and their distributors.",
      forWho: "European makers of aluminium, PVC and wood windows and doors, their sales and office teams, plus the dealers who sell their products.",
      does: "The configurator prices complete aluminium window and door quotes, line by line, with a drawing and prices from the maker's technical catalog. A distributor sends a project once and gets comparable quotes from several makers. A shared back office runs companies, catalogs and imports, with one login for every app.",
